  "title": "May I come in?",
  "goal": "Ask for permission, make polite requests and say what may happen: Girebilir miyim? Yağmur yağabilir.",
  "points": ["gp-abil-uses", "gp-abil", "gp-ama-inability"],
  "intro": {
    "text": "`-(y)Abil` also asks for permission (*Girebilir miyim?* May I come in?), makes polite requests (*Tuzu verebilir misiniz?* Could you pass the salt?) and says what may happen (*Yağmur yağabilir*). **May not** is `-mAyAbil`: *Gelmeyebilir* (He may not come).",
    "see": "gp-abil-uses"
  },
